 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Ultimate Tutorial Warrior"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "en": "Warrior Kim Builds up His Traits"
   },
   {
    "ko": "특성 쌓는 김전사"
   },
   {
    "en": "Trait Hoarder"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Junsu is an ordinary college student who spends an extraordinary amount of time trying to beat a pay-to-win hero collector game called Arcane Seoul. \n\nAll his hours of painstaking gameplay finally pays off when he lands Cheonma, one of the ultimate SS-ranked characters in the game, seconds before a truck runs him over. Now, he finds himself as Jeonsa Kim, a basic tutorial-stage character who can learn any skill. \n\nCan he use his gaming knowledge to survive the godforsaken, magic-driven, and monster-ridden alternate world of Arcane Seoul?",
   "ko": "모바일 게임 ‘아케인서울’의 무과금 랭커 김준수.게임 속 튜토리얼 캐릭터 ‘김전사’에 빙의해버렸다!?\n\n약육강식의 게임 세계에서 기본캐 김전사로 살아남아야 하는 상황.믿을 건 무과금으로 랭커가 된 준수의 엄청난 게임 지식과나약하지만 무제한으로 특성을 바꿔 낄 수 있는 김전사의 육체다."
  },
